# Folder placeholders — documented structure (docs/02-architecture/architecture.md §2.1)
#
# src/components/ - React components (ui/, cards/, social/, layout/)
# src/services/   - business logic (reading.service.ts, social.service.ts, ...)
# src/stores/     - Zustand stores (reading.store.ts, ui.store.ts, user.store.ts)
# src/types/      - domain contracts
# public/         - static assets
# tests/          - automated tests